                <pb facs="0893" n="757" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg757"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 13 in No. 973.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blacklock to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Apia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-09-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 4,
                    1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Samoans at war. General revolt against Tamasese. Affairs more serious than
                    ever.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Blacklock.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
